    <p>Starhela Agencies extends its reach to Nigeria and the rest of the world using localized payment gateways. With competitive referral commissions and global task availability, users from Lagos to Abuja can participate in the digital economy using NGN. Registration is open to all international members looking to leverage social media for profit.</p>

    <div class="country-grid">
        <div class="country-card">
            <h3>GLOBAL/NIGERIA</h3>
            <a href="https://starhela.com/register.php?ref=LACER" class="action-link btn-gold"><i class="fas fa-globe"></i> GLOBAL REGISTRATION</a>
